title Home Assistant: Settings (the last row of the All tab): server address and user, the tiles' keys (Enter, Ctrl+O); Sign out asks, then the token is revoked and the Connect page shows
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO home

wait 1600
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
wait 600
key end
key enter
wait 500
shot settings
check settings
expect text "Server"
expect text "Signed in as"
expect text "deck"
key end
wait 300
expect text "Tile action"
expect text "Enter"
expect text "Ctrl+O"
expect text "Sign out"
shot settings-end
check settings-end
key enter
wait 300
expect text "Sign out of Home Assistant?"
shot confirm-signout
check confirm-signout
key enter
wait 1200
expect text "Signed out. Scan the code to sign in again."
expect text "Scan with your phone to connect to Home Assistant"
shot signed-out
check signed-out
expect noquit
